<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on telecom stocks basket.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on telecom stocks basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Tuesday it has launched 68 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong telecommunications stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> First Pacific Co Ltd			    1   share</p>
<p> Hongkong Telecommunications Ltd	     1   share</p>
<p> Hutchison Whampoa Ltd			   0.4 shares</p>
<p> SmarTone Telecommunications Holdings Ltd  0.5 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$49.50	  PREMIUM	  10.34 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$1.1187	 GEARING	  4.92X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     12.NOV.97	 PAYDATE	  25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   27.NOV.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE HK$55.00</p>
<p> NOTES	    GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
